msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Excuse me, what are you doing here?⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"You. Yes, ⟪k:28⟫you⟪k:29⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Excusez-moi, qu’est-ce que vous faites ici ?⟪k:26⟫"
"⟪k:27⟫Vous. Oui, ⟪k:28⟫vous⟪k:29⟫."

#: omake:omake_99725F62_CFF6_4816_BE61_F39AD06CACFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1c2bc0405e0fdbbaaa627bfadd0898ced9d2ae796fe2e70a972e5d2a89b6cde
#. default-sha256: 647d5954e26470ee800bc37fb036fe80d279fc64b18d6e28d0a87a49577a524f
msgctxt "omake:omake_99725F62_CFF6_4816_BE61_F39AD06CACFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wish I knew how all these uninvited souls kept finding their way to my mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’aimerais bien savoir comment ça se fait que toutes ces âmes arrivent au manoir "
"sans y avoir été invitées."

#: omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a454a97208b2f26260a552842141217927cd69393a1fa6b83bb7b78dc5807ad
#. default-sha256: 8ada9c19c2d3bbf44b6c91e1f608c43bbbf98fc8be3c4cbd0728c87284b2388d
msgctxt "omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you just completed the game and would like some time to dwell on it, you are welcome "
"to head back now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Si vous venez de terminer le jeu et si vous avez besoin de laisser passer un peu de "
"temps, vous êtes libre de rebrousser chemin."

#: omake:omake_9790113F_2F86_4B78_AC2E_10D8DB9E56B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db25b1aad578ec71a99885a622f8faa7877988796e029a21d70b7936cfb6f9d2
#. default-sha256: e2c42007acc640f64620a3499296868ace77859d53c72451da9dbd6f3f241d0a
msgctxt "omake:omake_9790113F_2F86_4B78_AC2E_10D8DB9E56B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ll see people who shouldn’t be here. Things that contradict the events of the game. "
"A general sense of pandemonium. You’d do best not to think much of any of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous allez voir des gens qui ne devraient pas être ici. Des choses qui contredisent les "
"événements du jeu. Ce sera un joyeux chaos. Vous feriez mieux de ne pas trop y prêter attention."

#: omake:omake_8B5E920F_01AA_4FFF_9770_40716C0F563B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ef3fb9f224a8cbb7a7b9d32d76e48933106b1038980539406aa9fffb09acacd
#. default-sha256: 741b8c7fcb0b84e4221de7a4a658e08b610b994c88159151fc5d1483c5867ee8
msgctxt "omake:omake_8B5E920F_01AA_4FFF_9770_40716C0F563B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m not particularly attached to having long hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je n’ai pas spécialement envie d’avoir les cheveux longs."

#: omake:omake_9972D410_BE8F_48F7_AC27_7AAC30A66518
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1498aeb73df527ce0434a3e93372af77e0c4d50aba148f3b550e2c6aa857c00
#. default-sha256: 51be2e9ced702c492955499b40e5f369eb2b8f781674e8b459494eab4f7e64c4
msgctxt "omake:omake_9972D410_BE8F_48F7_AC27_7AAC30A66518"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mmm, I’m not sure how I feel about that idea.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I quite enjoy playing with your hair, "
"myself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mmm, je ne sais pas trop.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’aime beaucoup jouer avec tes cheveux, moi."

#: omake:omake_3FF00017_67C5_48C1_A183_28621D7983CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccd322109b849332d77a9d98cd0f702bedcd397c3260108409ad8786c5434a63
