#: omake:omake_8ECB75DE_A59F_4C1D_BB6E_A69FF03B42DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a99833d294edda052287dac335e82e07b4d916206774d3de3fcd7173200aceab
