msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh, so you can’t see the soul beside me?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That’s quite a shame."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah, vous ne voyez donc pas l’âme qui se tient à côté de moi ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Comme c’est "
"dommage."

#: omake:omake_13AF1031_2797_48CE_9EED_67E0B79A030B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 546abc975091a8b55db720a86250ca63290b6242025a980b8a8b0c0a8d4ed6e5
#. default-sha256: b4ca991bb7fcedb158926146ee6ccffb7ef7971727ea78bb514b50aaf69f89e7
msgctxt "omake:omake_13AF1031_2797_48CE_9EED_67E0B79A030B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Could they be who was watching over us?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I had better give them my thanks, then."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’est celle qui a veillé sur nous ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je ferais mieux de la remercier, dans ce "
"cas."

#: omake:omake_E7370332_3116_4855_B56E_38B937D881A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
