msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Peut-on vraiment me considérer comme le protagoniste ?"

#: omake:omake_0535F53B_0B78_4FF4_9665_CF91D0F6BE66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8003165a07196011b362af7e274cf3da5386c5ed9d87cf47d9464d0f7f06997e
