msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quoi, tu t’es encore cogné la tête, t’as de nouveau perdu la mémoire ?"

#: omake:omake_9843F3CD_5378_4F13_99A0_EB4DB9DFFDAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7550c993b6bc7a9454d5b7537df2d062b7e0e448555aa47590159b5f65a983d
